.TH REDOPS 1 "January 2025" "RedOPS 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
redops \- Professional Cybersecurity Intelligence & Attack Surface Management Platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B redops
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B RedOPS
is a modular security assessment framework for authorized penetration testing,
red team engagements, and security audits. It provides automated reconnaissance,
threat intelligence, and AI-powered analysis capabilities.
.PP
\fBIMPORTANT:\fR RedOPS is designed for authorized security assessments only.
Always obtain proper authorization before scanning any target.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Increase verbosity (can be repeated).
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress output except errors.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-color
Disable colored output.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output\-dir " " \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default: ./output).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: json, html, markdown, text, summary.
.TP
.BR \-\-config " " \fIFILE\fR
Path to configuration file.
.TP
.BR \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be done without executing.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS scan
Run a security scan on a target.
.PP
.B redops scan
\fITARGET\fR [\fB\-\-preset\fR \fIPRESET\fR] [\fB\-\-modules\fR \fIMODULES\fR]
.PP
Presets: quick, recon, full, compliance, infrastructure, threat_intel, executive, ai_enhanced
.SS report
Generate a report from scan results.
.PP
.B redops report
\fB\-i\fR \fIFILE\fR [\fB\-\-type\fR executive|technical|summary]
.SS modules
List available scan modules.
.PP
.B redops modules
.SS presets
List available scan presets.
.PP
.B redops presets
.SS ai
AI-assisted analysis commands.
.PP
.B redops ai
\fIACTION\fR [\fB\-q\fR \fIQUERY\fR] [\fB\-i\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-p\fR \fIPROVIDER\fR]
.PP
Actions: analyze, explain, suggest, summarize, chat
.SS apikey
Manage API keys.
.PP
.B redops apikey
\fIACTION\fR [\fB\-p\fR \fIPROVIDER\fR]
.PP
Actions: list, set, get, remove
.SS settings
Open interactive settings menu.
.SS config
Manage configuration.
.PP
.B redops config
show|init|path
.SS version
Show version information.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Quick scan a domain:
.B redops scan example.com \-\-preset quick
.TP
Full security assessment:
.B redops scan example.com \-\-preset full \-o ./reports
.TP
AI-enhanced scan (requires API key):
.B redops scan example.com \-\-preset ai_enhanced
.TP
Explain a security concept:
.B redops ai explain \-q "What is SQL injection?"
.TP
Analyze scan results with AI:
.B redops ai analyze \-i scan_results.json
.TP
Configure API key:
.B redops apikey set \-p anthropic
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
API key for Anthropic Claude AI models.
.TP
.B OPENAI_API_KEY
API key for OpenAI GPT models.
.TP
.B REDOPS_OUTPUT_DIR
Default output directory.
.TP
.B REDOPS_VERBOSE
Enable verbose output (true/false).
.TP
.B REDOPS_STRICT_SCOPE
Enable strict scope validation (true/false).
.TP
.B SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL
Slack webhook for notifications.
.TP
.B DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL
Discord webhook for notifications.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/redops/config.json
User configuration file.
.TP
.I config/pipelines/*.json
Pipeline definition files.
.TP
.I completions/redops.bash
Bash completion script.
.TP
.I completions/redops.zsh
Zsh completion script.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
General error.
.TP
.B 2
Configuration or scope error.
.SH SECURITY
RedOPS includes several security features:
.IP \(bu 2
Scope validation to prevent unauthorized scanning
.IP \(bu 2
Audit logging for compliance
.IP \(bu 2
Non-root Docker execution
.IP \(bu 2
Safe-by-default configuration
